# Math Visualiser UI Verification Checklist

- [ ] Open http://localhost:3001
- [ ] Inspect the Overlay (top left). Check if the title and description have good spacing and feel like a premium 'card'.
- [ ] Inspect the Timeline (bottom). Check if the play button has the new glass design (with gold glow when not playing).
- [ ] Check the scrubber. Verify it is a clean line and the 'playhead' dot follows the progress.
- [ ] Verify the active step marker in the sidebar (open menu if needed).
- [ ] Capture a final screenshot of the integrated UI.
- [ ] Return a summary of why the design now feels 'Editorial' and 'Premium'.
